    "跟住": ["我哋食飯，跟住去睇戲。","We'll eat, then go to a movie."],
    "然後": ["直行，然後轉左。","Go straight, then turn left."],
    "之後": ["食完飯之後我哋去行街。","After dinner we'll go shopping."],
    "嘅時候": ["我喺香港嘅時候成日飲茶。","When I was in Hong Kong I had dim sum all the time."],
